{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津じゃーん！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/moblAzkM6.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！こんばんは！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津玲奈です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広島公演"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乃木坂46としても3年ぶり、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6期生が入ってからは初めて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広島公演をさせて頂きました！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "暑い中来てくださった方も"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "心の中でいつも応援してくださっている方も"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても楽しかったです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広島は高校生の時に訪れたことがあり"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "駅前の雰囲気や揚げもみじ饅頭に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "懐かしさを感じました🍁"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "高校生の時に食べた"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とっても大きくて美味しかった焼き牡蠣📷"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobDoSC45.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "焼き牡蠣に七味をかけて食べるのが"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最高なの！！！！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また食べたいなぁ🦪"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そしてそして、"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津の大好物、、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あなご！！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広島に来てあなごを食べずに帰るのは"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小津玲奈の名が廃るというものです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "以前食べた「あなごめし」が"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "本当に美味しすぎて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "絶対にまた食べたいと思っていたの"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobEjEsB8.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "（前に食べたあなごめし！）"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回もあなごめしを食べることができて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても嬉しかったです！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なぜ広島であなごが有名なのか？"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それは、、、ﾓｸﾞﾓｸﾞ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "あ！れいな博士があなごに夢中で"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "解説してくれません！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もう！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "れいな博士に代わって私が解説します！"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "調べたところによると、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "牡蠣の養殖を行ういかだの下に"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "泥が溜まる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "↓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "小魚などの小さな生き物が集まる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "↓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "それを食べにあなごがやってくる"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "という仕組みなんだとか"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "牡蠣もあなごもたくさん取れるなんて"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幸せですね〜〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "素敵な食べ物がたくさんある"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "広島！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "幸せな時間をありがとうございました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また広島に来れるように"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "頑張ります！！！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "・乃木坂スター誕生！SIX"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Da-iCEさんの「スターマイン」を"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "パフォーマンスさせて頂きました！！"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/diary/n46/MEMBER/moblog/202607/mobmKFmp9.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回東京出身のうるみとひなと"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "「エドルデン」"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "として披露させて頂けて嬉しかったです"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "とても難しかったのですが"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "パフォーマンスさせて頂けて幸せでした"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "Huluでもぜひご覧ください！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "https://www.hulu.jp/nogizaka-star-is-born"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ツアーもいよいよ折り返し！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "明日からの大阪公演も"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "よろしくお願いします！！！"}], "source": "official"}